<GenericPage title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogImage="" bodyHtml={`<div class="entry-content single-content"><div class="alignnone"><div><div><div><h2>Contact Dinweys Biotech for Feed Additive Sourcing</h2><p>Dinweys Biotech connects global buyers with premium Chinese <a href="/product/" title="Feed additives">feed additive</a> manufacturers. Whether you need <a href="/product/choline-chloride-60/" title="Choline Chloride 60% Feed Additive – Corn Cob Carrier China Manufacturer Supply">choline chloride</a>, betaine, <a href="/product/dcp-dicalcium-phosphate-17/" title="DCP17">DCP</a>, amino acids, <a href="/product/" title="vitamins">vitamins</a>, or enzymes, our team provides competitive pricing, quality documentation, and reliable logistics. Contact us today to discuss your requirements.</p></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><div><h2>Get in Touch</h2><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@dinweys.com">info@dinweys.com</a></p><p><strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong> +86 13610811901</p><p><strong>Office Location:</strong> Anhui, China</p><p><strong>Business Hours:</strong> Monday–Friday, 09:00–18:00 (CST)</p><p><strong>Response Time:</strong> Within 24 hours for all inquiries</p><h2>Our Product Range</h2><ul><li><strong>Choline Chloride</strong> — 60% corn cob, 60% silica, 50% corn cob, 75% liquid</li><li><strong>Betaine</strong> — Betaine HCl 96%/98%, Betaine Anhydrous</li><li><strong>Dicalcium Phosphate (DCP)</strong> — DCP 17% and <a href="/product/dcp-18-powder/" title="DCP18">DCP 18</a>%</li><li><strong>Phytase &amp; Enzymes</strong> — Heat-stable phytase, granular phytase</li><li><strong>Amino Acids</strong> — L-Lysine Sulphate 70%, DL-Methionine, L-Threonine</li><li><strong>Vitamins</strong> — B2 (Riboflavin), C (Ascorbic Acid), E, A, D3</li></ul><p>Each product is supplied with complete documentation: Certificate of Analysis (COA), HPLC/LC-MS traces, heavy metal analysis, and microbiological testing reports.</p></div></div><div><div><h2>How to Place an Order</h2><ol><li><strong>Submit Inquiry</strong> — Send your product list and volume requirements</li><li><strong>Receive Quotation</strong> — Get competitive pricing within 24 hours</li><li><strong>Quality Review</strong> — Request COA, samples, and third-party testing</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation</strong> — Agree on terms, payment, and shipping schedule</li><li><strong>Production &amp; Inspection</strong> — Factory production with quality checkpoint</li><li><strong>Shipping &amp; Delivery</strong> — FOB, CIF, or DDP to your destination port</li></ol><p>We serve feed mills, import distributors, and animal nutrition companies worldwide. <strong>Dinweys Biotech</strong> is your reliable partner for feed additive procurement from China.</p></div></div></div></div></div>`} />
